@startuml SIPAM_Deployment_Diagram

!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #F5F2EA

title SIPAM-USCO - Diagrama de Despliegue en AWS

node "Usuario" as User {
    artifact "Browser" as Browser
    artifact "Mobile" as Mobile
}

cloud "Internet" as Internet

node "AWS Cloud" as AWS {
    
    node "us-east-2 Region" as Region {
        
        node "VPC" as VPC {
            
            node "EC2 Instance" as EC2 {
                
                node "Ubuntu 22.04 LTS" as OS {
                    
                    node "Docker Engine" as Docker {
                        
                        node "Docker Compose Network" as Compose {
                            
                            rectangle "Frontend Service" #E8F5E9 {
                                [Nginx Container] as NginxC
                                portin "80" as P80
                            }
                            
                            rectangle "Backend Service" #FFEBEE {
                                [FastAPI Container] as FastAPIC
                                portin "8000" as P8000
                            }
                            
                            rectangle "AI Service" #F3E5F5 {
                                [Flask Container] as FlaskC
                                portin "5001" as P5001
                            }
                            
                            rectangle "Database Service" #E3F2FD {
                                [PostgreSQL Container] as PostgresC
                                portin "5432" as P5432
                                [Volume: postgres\_data] as VolDB
                            }
                            
                        }
                        
                    }
                    
                }
                
                portin "22 (SSH)" as P22
                portin "80 (HTTP)" as PHTTP
                
            }
            
            node "Security Group" as SG {
                rectangle "Inbound Rules" {
                    [Allow 22 from MyIP]
                    [Allow 80 from 0.0.0.0/0]
                }
            }
            
        }
        
    }
    
}

' Conexiones
User --> Internet : HTTP/HTTPS
Internet --> PHTTP : 18.222.152.152

P80 --> NginxC
NginxC --> P8000 : /api/v1/*
FastAPIC --> P5432 : SQLAlchemy
FastAPIC ..> P5001 : HTTP

PostgresC --> VolDB : Persistencia

' Labels
note right of EC2
  **Tipo:** t3.medium
  **vCPU:** 2
  **RAM:** 4 GB
  **IP Pública:** 18.222.152.152
  **DNS:** ec2-18-222-152-152.us-east-2.compute.amazonaws.com
end note

note bottom of Docker
  **Versión:** Docker 24.x
  **Compose:** v2.x
  **Imágenes:**
  - nginx:alpine
  - python:3.11-slim (backend)
  - python:3.11-slim (ai)
  - postgres:15-alpine
end note

note right of SG
  **Firewall AWS**
  - SSH (22): Solo IP admin
  - HTTP (80): Público
  - HTTPS (443): Público (futuro)
end note

@enduml
